{"id":"vod_sn_38777","vodId":"38777","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"阿拉德战记","name_cn":"阿拉德战记","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8bcec06951b51af918855f38b56a5009.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在阿拉德历977年，巴隆（近藤隆 配音）因为受到了卡赞的诅咒而致使左手“鬼化”，成为了不详和灾祸的象征，因而遭到了村民的驱逐，被迫离开家乡。和附身在巨剑上的精灵罗克希（渡边明乃 配音）一起，巴隆踏上了旅途，希望能够找到解开诅咒的办法。　　正直勇敢的神枪手卡本西斯（铃村健一 配音）、活泼开朗的女格斗家纽梅（野川樱 配音）、率真直爽的魔法师依克希尔（辻亚由美 配音）、热情喜感的牧师杰达（黑田崇矢 配音）、同样身中诅咒的阿甘左（浜田贤二 配音），一路上，巴隆结识了各种各样的伙伴，一行人在无畏之中前行，渐渐抵达事件的真相。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:33","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/501GKWQjs91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/drq3v6Xq0Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rbp3iEqQWr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eAbJpsfp431/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dCf8q7gkdq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sEiY6qQNjj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w8NCdfTpAC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CUK3xsPEEd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bpqRgmNyWd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iXRabCMPWZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xdf6xF8F9J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zxAMw2RGHU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZFyrF7h9HJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tmMDigLskx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rst